{"title":"Reaver","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 28 Bandit that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 4 times (1.4% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/cutthroats-hone\">Cutthroats Hone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>, <a href=\"#/item/pirates-windlass\">Pirates Windlass</a> <span class=\"muted\">(archers only; rerolls quality)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/reaver\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/reaver?lv=26\">Lv 26 <span>103</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/reaver?lv=27\">Lv 27 <span>374</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/reaver?lv=28\">Lv 28 <span>598</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/reaver?lv=29\">Lv 29 <span>381</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/reaver?lv=30\">Lv 30 <span>191</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/reaver?lv=31\">Lv 31 <span>79</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/reaver?lv=32\">Lv 32 <span>18</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/reaver?lv=33\">Lv 33 <span>12</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><